WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.577
Maxie: What’s your favorite subject, Taco?

2
00:00:07.578 --> 00:00:10.396
Taco: My favorite subject is music.

3
00:00:10.397 --> 00:00:11.828
What about you? Maxie:

4
00:00:11.829 --> 00:00:16.384
My favorite subject is art.

5
00:00:16.385 --> 00:00:19.558
Taco: What is Alex’s favorite subject?

6
00:00:19.559 --> 00:00:24.907
Maxie: His favorite subject is math.

7
00:00:24.908 --> 00:00:26.887
Taco: Where are we?

8
00:00:26.888 --> 00:00:31.261
Maxie: I don’t know. We’re lost!

9
00:00:31.262 --> 00:00:34.565
Taco: Let’s get out of here, Maxie!

10
00:00:34.566 --> 00:00:36.225
Maxie: Wait a minute.

11
00:00:36.226 --> 00:00:39.452
What is your favorite ride?

12
00:00:39.453 --> 00:00:42.235
Taco: I like balloon rides!

13
00:00:42.236 --> 00:00:48.193
Maxie: Okay, let’s take a balloon ride!

14
00:00:48.194 --> 00:00:55.447
Taco: Off we go! Yippie!

